# Nothing in the app reads a VITE_* variable today.
#
# The API prefix is NOT one: it is fixed at /api/v1 and lives in
# src/constants/routes.ts as API_PREFIX, because nginx.conf, the EventSource
# URL and the Google OAuth anchor all hardcode it too — a variable that moved
# only the axios base would break the notification stream and Google sign-in
# silently. See the README's "The API prefix is fixed".
#
# This file is kept so that adding a real variable has somewhere to go.
